   "resumo_en": "Canned Wheat is the fifth studio album by Canadian rock band the Guess Who, released in September 1969. It peaked at number 91 on the Billboard Pop Albums chart.  Two of the band's hits were taken from the album: \"Laughing\" and \"Undun\". The album also includes the original version of \"No Time\" which would later be re-recorded for their American Woman album and released as a single. The album is regarded as a rock classic.",
